{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "c810c1230d461f0362376591cd22a96497a43f5f7579a5fb80697cd901b99c52", "ja": "ちょっぴり背伸びの、この衣装～♪\n今日の可奈は、大人っぽいかな～♪", "zh": "稍微长大一点的这身服装～♪\n今天的可奈，是不是很有成熟感呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
