{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "e42d3abf09b8a6c0e2884033a9ec3ce3c39844301909b9cc5e19231594902f2a", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nはい！　だって、とっても素敵なんですもん！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n是呀！因为真的特别棒嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "3268396f238533fce2907177f7e56778c9dcce831244f4a51102fa528f02adda", "ja": "ちょっぴりセクシーで……。私も、こういう衣装を\n着られるようになったんだなーって、嬉しくて♪", "zh": "有一点性感……我也已经能穿上这样的服装了，感觉好开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3dd1a3c43c8082b5e645268dffe8783b6a2d92672c0954473a7767909fd3ece3", "ja": "そうだったのか。うん。可奈によく似合ってるし、\n大人っぽくて素敵だと思うよ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。嗯，很适合可奈，\n我觉得看起来很成熟，也很漂亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "a0d9d6b3177cce79bc010af9baa2f24dba99d0a8c08b062c257104b0326758f9", "ja": "！　お、大人っぽくて……素敵……！？\nえへ、えへへへへ……。", "zh": "！大、大人气质……好棒……！？嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "0ce361e959dae712edbd3823eddbec63cda81b773b04d03c189bd1fa944bae11", "ja": "ハッ！　そ、そうだ！　さっきの歌なんですけど、\nなんだか違う感じがしませんでしたか？", "zh": "啊！对、对了！关于刚才唱的那首歌，\n你是不是也觉得好像有点不太一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b359ab40603ae039f215ba057a215ad57f6808c06b5b95c0093770afeb1a57d9", "ja": "さっきの？　ああ、声をかける前に歌ってた歌だな。\n確かに、ちょっと雰囲気が……。", "zh": "刚才那首？啊，就是你搭话之前唱的歌吧。确实，感觉有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "4bc65e0673d745537d73ebce7f3c940252829c7940dee678645a666257bb5309", "ja": "そうなんですっ！　私は、いつも通り歌ってるだけ\nなんですけど、不思議ですね～？", "zh": "就是这样！我明明只是像平时一样唱歌而已，可真奇怪呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1009_p", "source_sha256": "842dbb396b0e7a8038389a31d2a99d07e0e18f6d1d7deb1bb6b920e1198a28ef", "ja": "そうだな。でも何か違う部分があるから、そうなった\nわけで……。いつもと違うところといえば……。", "zh": "是啊。不过，肯定是因为有某些地方不一样，才会变成这样的……要说和往常不同的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "881be1c0a43107343ac12943c8876d265846b95c3e1e9b1cc63ca6e9b7ed5e0f", "ja": "衣装、ですかね。……言われてみれば、\n歌ってても、気分が落ち着いている気がするんです。", "zh": "是……衣服吧。……您这么一说，我发现唱歌的时候，心情好像真的比较沉稳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "f5bb8f9951eb9ab8b3a5b7f96f2dbf715697742b3d6ddd2066be8d95416b5e1a", "ja": "この衣装、上品な感じですから……\n私も、衣装に似合う私にならなきゃって思って。", "zh": "这套服装给人一种优雅的感觉……所以我也觉得，自己得成为与这套服装相称的自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1012_p", "source_sha256": "53e3e4ac380134fe1c287848f9c6d2b04fbe4ccab799a28d4e625807e4956dfe", "ja": "なるほどな……。いいことじゃないか？\n格好ひとつで、気分が変わることはよくあるし……。", "zh": "原来如此……这不是件好事吗？\n有时候，光是换一身打扮，心情就会改变……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1013_p", "source_sha256": "79fa853aca7b00a03b16006f659238eee76a482be584c8eb73a65c96d88a47df", "ja": "気分が変われば、歌声だって変わることもあるんじゃ\nないかな。", "zh": "心情一变，歌声也可能随之改变，\n不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "132d8138f5934de63890885e2d4004686b927fae039e27e92875099b08d96e3d", "ja": "ですよね！　かわいい衣装の時は、気分も弾んで、\n歌声も、明るくて楽しい感じになって！", "zh": "对吧！穿上可爱的服装时，心情也会变得雀跃，歌声也会变得明快又欢快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "8cdc9b36642baf75e44194814fff4a38790038d353f019cf1607557138cae041", "ja": "大人っぽい時は、ちょっと気が引き締まって、\nカッコよくて、クールな歌声になると思うんです！", "zh": "成熟风格的时候，就会觉得有些紧张严肃，\n感觉歌声也会变得又帅气又酷呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1016_p", "source_sha256": "667e61d2983b9af4fd74275608247286cb5180010ce2851bf05ea238fbbde1f7", "ja": "ああ。それなら今の可奈は、\n大人っぽい魅力の詰まった歌になるってことかな？", "zh": "啊。这样的话，现在的可奈唱的歌里，\n就会充满成熟的魅力了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "40680b06c228484d82a1c3b3b64480a79268f9a4f9f866002157ac03a209852b", "ja": "……そうですね！　大人の魅力が……えへへ♪\n大人っぽい矢吹可奈、歌いますっ！", "zh": "……没错呢！成熟的魅力……嘿嘿♪\n成熟魅力的矢吹可奈，要开始唱歌啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0684_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "7ced0ce98462b6da7cb4a24e0c1b695dc4b041a4626034f4c962d0f743f0a22c", "ja": "背筋がのびる、この衣装～♪\n可奈の歌声、変わっているかな～♪　……えへっ♪", "zh": "这身衣服让人不由得挺直腰背～♪\n可奈的歌声，有没有变得不一样呢～♪……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
